CalcViews::calcFlows - action rendering (render asInterconnectionDiagram, view def ActionFlowView)

the rendering is empty: nothing the view exposes is shown by an action rendering

not represented:
  - calc Calcs::add is no action; an action rendering does not show it
  - calc def Calcs::Add is no action; an action rendering does not show it
  - calc Calcs::Totaliser::total is no action; an action rendering does not show it
  - calc def Calcs::Stepwise is no action; an action rendering does not show it
